WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:05.620
"Our ship is ruined!" Zoop cried.

2
00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:09.058
The spacefish dived back into the water.

3
00:00:09.059 --> 00:00:15.070
Splash! A big wave rose up.

4
00:00:15.071 --> 00:00:19.038
Ringo saw Freezies slip off the ice.

5
00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:30.663
"Ahh!" Zoop fell into the water.

6
00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:36.554
"Grab . . . my hand!" Ringo said.

7
00:00:36.555 --> 00:00:43.724
He pulled Zoop back onto the ice.

8
00:00:43.725 --> 00:00:48.829
Other Freezies floated in the water.

9
00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:53.435
They climbed onto ice chunks.

10
00:00:53.436 --> 00:00:59.319
The ice bobbed in the waves.

11
00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.117
"Oh no!" Zoop said.

12
00:01:02.118 --> 00:01:05.800
"Everyone is drifting apart!"

13
00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:10.575
"Help!" a Freezie cried.

14
00:01:10.576 --> 00:01:13.637
"Vitty's in danger!" Zoop said.

15
00:01:13.638 --> 00:01:17.060
Vitty was on a tiny piece of ice.

16
00:01:17.061 --> 00:01:24.153
The spacefish swam by.

17
00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:28.786
"Help!" she called again.

18
00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:36.500
"We'll help!" Ringo said.

19
00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:44.389
He and Bot got in their spaceship.

20
00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:48.078
The ship flew over the ice chunks.

21
00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:53.657
Ringo opened the hatch.

22
00:01:53.658 --> 00:01:57.825
Bot reached down with her long arm.

23
00:01:57.826 --> 00:02:02.480
"Vitty, grab my arm!" she said.

24
00:02:02.481 --> 00:02:15.183
Vitty held on tightly.

25
00:02:15.184 --> 00:02:22.701
Bot put Vitty down with Zoop.

26
00:02:22.702 --> 00:02:36.003
Ringo and Bot rescued more Freezies.

27
00:02:36.004 --> 00:02:40.243
Bot put down the last Freezie.

28
00:02:40.244 --> 00:02:44.911
She started to bring her arm back up.

29
00:02:44.912 --> 00:02:49.194
Splash! The spacefish leaped from the water.

30
00:02:49.195 --> 00:02:54.335
Chomp! It grabbed Bot's arm with its teeth.

31
00:02:54.336 --> 00:03:00.892
"Bot!" Ringo cried.

